<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Cat FAQ</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --bg: #f5f7fb;
      --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      --surface-strong: #ffffff;
      --text: #1f2937;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --border: #e5e7eb;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --accent-soft: #dbeafe;
      --shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      --radius: 20px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, #e0f2fe 0, transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 32px 16px;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(920px, 100%);
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.8);
      border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 6px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 40px 40px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fbff 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      max-width: 60ch;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .faq {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .example {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--surface-strong);
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
    }

    .example:hover {
      border-color: #cbd5e1;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .question {
      width: 100%;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: inherit;
      font: inherit;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .question:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent-soft);
      outline-offset: -3px;
    }

    .question-text {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.04rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .icon {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 180ms ease, background-color 180ms ease;
    }

    .question[aria-expanded="true"] .icon {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      background: #dbeafe;
    }

    .details {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 24px 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .details[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    .details p {
      margin: 16px 0 0;
    }

    .details ul {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .details li + li {
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      body {
        padding: 0;
      }

      .page {
        border-radius: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      .hero,
      .faq {
        padding-left: 20px;
        padding-right: 20px;
      }

      .question {
        padding-left: 18px;
        padding-right: 18px;
      }

      .details {
        padding-left: 18px;
        padding-right: 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cat FAQ</p>
      <h1 id="faq-title">Everything you wanted to know about cats</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        A clean, quick guide to common cat questions. Tap a question to reveal the answer.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-1" id="cat-faq-btn-1">
          <span class="question-text">Why do cats purr?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-faq-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-1" hidden>
          <p>Cats often purr when they feel safe and content, but they may also purr when they are anxious, in pain, or asking for comfort.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-2" id="cat-faq-btn-2">
          <span class="question-text">How much sleep do cats need?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-faq-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-2" hidden>
          <p>Most cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day. Kittens and senior cats may sleep even more as part of normal healthy behavior.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-3" id="cat-faq-btn-3">
          <span class="question-text">Why do cats knead with their paws?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-faq-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-3" hidden>
          <p>Kneading is a comfort behavior that starts in kittenhood. Adult cats often do it when they are relaxed, bonded, or settling into a cozy spot.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-4" id="cat-faq-btn-4">
          <span class="question-text">Do cats really hate water?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="cat-faq-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-4" hidden>
          <p>Not all cats dislike water. Many are simply cautious about being wet, but some breeds and individuals enjoy splashing or even swimming.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const items = document.querySelectorAll('.example');

    items.forEach((item) => {
      const button = item.querySelector('.question');
      const panel = item.querySelector('.details');

      button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const expanded = button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
        button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
        panel.hidden = expanded;
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
