 <body>
   <main class="page">
     <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
       <p class="eyebrow">Cat FAQ</p>
       <h1 id="faq-title">Everything you wanted to know about cats</h1>
       <p class="subtitle">
         A clean, quick guide to common cat questions. Tap a question to reveal the answer.
       </p>
     </section>

     <section class="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
       <div class="example">
         <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-1" id="cat-faq-btn-1">
           <span class="question-text">Why do cats purr?</span>
           <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
         </button>
         <div class="details" id="cat-faq-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-1" hidden>
           <p>Cats often purr when they feel safe and content, but they may also purr when they are anxious, in pain, or asking for comfort.</p>
         </div>
       </div>

       <div class="example">
         <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-2" id="cat-faq-btn-2">
           <span class="question-text">How much sleep do cats need?</span>
           <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
         </button>
         <div class="details" id="cat-faq-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-2" hidden>
           <p>Most cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day. Kittens and senior cats may sleep even more as part of normal healthy behavior.</p>
         </div>
       </div>

       <div class="example">
         <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-3" id="cat-faq-btn-3">
           <span class="question-text">Why do cats knead with their paws?</span>
           <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
         </button>
         <div class="details" id="cat-faq-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-3" hidden>
           <p>Kneading is a comfort behavior that starts in kittenhood. Adult cats often do it when they are relaxed, bonded, or settling into a cozy spot.</p>
         </div>
       </div>

       <div class="example">
         <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cat-faq-4" id="cat-faq-btn-4">
           <span class="question-text">Do cats really hate water?</span>
           <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
         </button>
         <div class="details" id="cat-faq-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="cat-faq-btn-4" hidden>
           <p>Not all cats dislike water. Many are simply cautious about being wet, but some breeds and individuals enjoy splashing or even swimming.</p>
         </div>
       </div>
     </section>
   </main>

   <script>
     const items = document.querySelectorAll('.example');

     items.forEach((item) => {
       const button = item.querySelector('.question');
       const panel = item.querySelector('.details');

       button.addEventListener('click', () => {
         const expanded = button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
         button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
         panel.hidden = expanded;
       });
